WEBVTT

04:31.883 --> 04:34.763
<b>The Bureau of Espionage, wasn't it?</b>

04:35.093 --> 04:37.103
<b>I hope you keep your promises.</b>

04:37.183 --> 04:39.103
<b>You owe me an explanation.</b>

04:39.563 --> 04:42.393
<b>His memory seems sharp as ever.</b>

04:42.813 --> 04:44.893
<b>Don't look at me like that!</b>
